    [tag accordion/INTERACTIVE cls=tag] text«[Accordion 1 title:]» after«Personal factors:»
    [tag body/ELEMENT cls=tag] text«[body text]» after«»
    [black] «Personal factors that influence hauora include things like a person’s own:»
    [black] «• values and beliefs about the situation – and whether these support their hauora»
    [black] «• feelings – such as self-worth, self-belief, self-confidence»
    [black] «• state of mind – such as self-esteem»
    [black] «• state of health – whether the person is physically or mentally well or not well»
    [black] «• knowledge – whether the person has the knowledge to know how to deal with the situation»
    [black] «• skills – such as being able to:»
    [black] «• manage self (for example, time management, set goals, plan, use stress management strate»
    [black] «• communicate effectively (for example, use I statements, give and receive feedback, liste»
    [black] «• be assertive»
    [black] «• make decisions»
    [black] «• problem solve»
    [black] «• think critically and rationally.»
    [black] «Note that some of these become interpersonal skills when they are used but they are a pers»
    [black] «• life experiences – whether the person has had experience managing situations like this b»
    [black] «• circumstances – such as the person’s financial resources, where they live, the stability»
    [tag accordion/INTERACTIVE cls=tag] text«[Accordion 2 title:]» after«Interpersonal factors:»
    [tag body/ELEMENT cls=tag] text«[body text]» after«»
    [black] «Interpersonal factors that influence hauora include things like:»
