    [black] «• the quality of communication between people»
    [black] «• the capabilities of people in relationships to communicate effectively – whether everyon»
    [black] «• the fact that a person has quality relationships with others»
    [black] «• how supportive and equal their relationships are – or if there is a power imbalance in t»
    [black] «• the values and beliefs of people about their relationships and how these are shown in th»
    [black] «• whether or not a person is being pressured or mistreated by those that they know (for ex»
