    [tag body/ELEMENT cls=tag] text«[body text]» after«»
    [black] «Societal factors that influence hauora include things like:»
    [black] «• cultural and social norms – attitudes, values, beliefs and practices that are shown and »
    [black] «• media – such as: news, film and TV, social media, music»
    [black] «• community events»
    [black] «• social organisations – such as: schools»
    [black] «• the provision of services in communities – what’s valued and available – and what isn’t»
    [black] «• who communities ‘include’ (and celebrate or embrace) and who they ‘exclude’ (and discrim»
    [black] «• globalisation – such as: multinational companies marketing of their goods, social media,»
    [black] «• the practices and traditions of ethnic and other cultural groups, or subcultures.»
    [black] «• laws and policies – how well these operate at national and local/community level (includ»
    [black] «• people’s access to resources – can be financial (usually what money buys) and includes a»
    [black] «Remember: think of societal as also being about (local) communities and not just nationwid»
    [tag accordion/INTERACTIVE cls=tag] text«[Accordion 4 title:]» after«Working out the difference»
    [tag body/ELEMENT cls=tag] text«[body text]» after«»
    [black] «It can be tricky in some situations working out if something is a personal, interpersonal,»
    [black] «We can think of it this way:»
    [black] «A **personal** factor is something an **individual** has control over – that is, our own:»
    [black] «• knowledge, values, attitudes, and beliefs. Even though these will have been shaped by ma»
